Adds re-export of `FetchConfig` that can be used inside Next.js's server components:

```jsx
import { FetchConfig } from 'http-react/dist/server'

export default async function Layout({ children }) {
  return (
    <div>
      <FetchConfig baseUrl='/api'>{children}</FetchConfig>
    </div>
  )
}

```

### Notes

Previously, code handling default value generation crashed when trying to generate default values for variables with function types. We're not sure how to deal with default function values yet, so this PR provides a short-term fix for the issue by avoiding any attempt to generate default values for function types.

